# Foundation phase (LocalFileSource) needs nothing — it reads CSVs straight
# off disk from ../data-generator/output. Override the path if you've moved
# the generator output elsewhere:
# GROUP_BI_DATA_DIR=../data-generator/output

# GoogleSheetsSource — set ALL of these to switch the dashboard from the
# synthetic demo data to your real Google Sheets workbooks (getDataSource.ts
# picks GoogleSheetsSource automatically once every var below is present).
# See docs/schema.md for the exact tab/column layout each workbook needs,
# and README.md for the full setup checklist (service account, sharing,
# etc). The service account only ever needs Viewer access — this source
# never writes to your sheets.
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_CLIENT_EMAIL=
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_PRIVATE_KEY=
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID_HAJJ_UMRAH=
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID_HOTEL=
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID_BAKERY=
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID_GROUP=

# Set to force the synthetic demo data even when the Sheets vars above are
# present — for pausing on real data without removing the Sheets config.
# GROUP_BI_FORCE_DEMO=true
